        {
          "id": 721052002,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Asterix disector is a perfect fit for automatic updates. The frequency of updates should not be a factor here.\nThe idea was to update it manually for a while (a few commits via merge requests), just to be sure there are no issues. Then it would be really a good idea to run this task automatically.",
